{{!
    @template local_ai_course_assistant/course_settings

    Per-course settings page: the link bar, the one big POST form and every card
    inside it (SOLA on/off, provider override, RAG plus the pedagogy toggles,
    supplemental courses, English lock, Voice Tab, Auto-open, starters, per-quiz
    assistance level and the token-usage link).

    Field names are load-bearing. Each input here posts under the same name the
    handler at the top of course_settings.php reads, so renaming one silently
    drops that setting on save.

    Strings are resolved in course_settings.php; there are no str helpers here.
    Every value is escaped except the three noted inline, which carry markup the
    page builds itself.

    The RAG card holds the pedagogy toggles, so they appear only when RAG is
    enabled site-wide. That is how the page behaved before this template and is
    deliberately preserved here.

    @package    local_ai_course_assistant
    @copyright  2026 Tom Caswell & David Ta / Saylor University
    @license    http://www.gnu.org/copyleft/gpl.html GNU GPL v3 or later

